    "title": "Google Just Put Gemini Inside Your Ads — What It Means for GCC Performance Marketers",
    "dek": "Google is weaving Gemini AI directly into Search ads, generating custom product explainers within sponsored placements — a structural change in paid search that performance marketers across MENA cannot afford to treat as incremental.",
    "date": "2026-05-20",
